   Goncalves, Emanuel/0000-0002-3918-6215
   Erzini, Karim/0000-0002-1411-0126
   Horta e Costa, Barbara/0000-0002-9960-3893
   Fragkopoulou, Eliza/0000-0002-0557-3954}},
